  "brain_first": "“不要问哪个最顺眼；问每个选项到底改了原文哪一个地方。”",
  "sort_order": 1031,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1369
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "四个选项都“像对的”；尤其细节、推断、主旨题",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1370
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "常用这种设计。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1371
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1372
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Distractor = 用原文部分信息制造的错误选项。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1373
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “不要问哪个最顺眼；问每个选项到底改了原文哪一个地方。”",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1374
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 会排干扰项能把“两个都像”变成可验证的逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1375
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1376
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先圈选项主语。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1377
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 再圈时间、数量、范围词（some/all, may/must）。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1378
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查因果方向。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1379
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 检查前半句和后半句是否都对。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1380
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 检查是否把例子变结论、把别人观点变作者观点。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1381
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1382
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1383
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1384
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· some → all = 范围扩大",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1385
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· may → must = 强度扩大",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1386
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· A causes B → B causes A = 因果反转",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1387
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 原文有这个词但回答另一个问题 = 原词陷阱",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1388
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 前半对后半错 = 整项错",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1389
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 你能给每个被排除选项说出一个具体错误点。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1390
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个都像时，优先比“范围、程度、主语、因果”，这些最容易藏错。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1391
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1392
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "原文：Some participants reported better sleep. 选项：The program improved sleep for all",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1393
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "participants. → some 被扩大成 all，错。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1394
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1395
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 因为选项“听起来合理”就选。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1396
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只验证前半句。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1397
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1398
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 主语对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1399
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 时间对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1400
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 因果对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1401
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 范围/程度被放大了吗？",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1402
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1403
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1404
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1405
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 干扰项就查四件事：谁、什么时候、为什么、范围多大。",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1406
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1408
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. some→all 属于什么陷阱？",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1409
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. may→must？",
      "sourcePage": 50,
      "sourceIndex": 1410
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. A causes B→B causes A？",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1411
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 选项前半对后半错，整体？",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1412
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 原文有同词但答非所问？",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1413
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 范围扩大；2. 程度/确定性扩大；3. 偷换因果；4. 错；5. 原词复现陷阱",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1414
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R17 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R17”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 51,
      "sourceIndex": 1415
    }
  ],
